## arkive — Architecture Tracking (MANDATORY)

**On EVERY session start:** Read `{{architectureFile}}` FIRST. It is your cross-session memory.
**Before ANY major change:** Re-read `{{architectureFile}}` to align your work.
**After ANY major change:** Update `{{architectureFile}}` via MCP tools or direct edit. Append a history entry.
**Before claiming completion:** Verify `{{architectureFile}}` reflects all changes made this session.

Major changes: adding/removing services, changing protocols, new frameworks, infrastructure changes, module boundary refactors.

**MCP tools:** `update_architecture`, `record_decision`, `check_drift`
**CLI:** `npx @ericjdz/arkive status` · `npx @ericjdz/arkive reconcile`
**Docs:** https://github.com/ericjdz/arkive
<!-- arkive:end -->
